-- ============================================================================
-- SECTION 2: LIVE PURE-.HYPERCUBICAL BUS SYNC STEP & CONTINUOUS DAEMON LOOP
--   Reads live store/ROOT/root + /tmp/hx_agent_bus/human_steer.jsonl,
--   writes agent_42gpu_foundry_state.json + appends to /tmp/hx_agent_bus/inbox.jsonl,
